    taken from battles involving this card. You can only use each of the following
    effects of "Ohime the Manifested Mikanko" once per turn. You can reveal this
    card in your hand; add 1 "Mikanko" card from your Deck to your hand, except "Ohime
    the Manifested Mikanko", then discard 1 card. (Quick Effect): You can target
    1 Equip Spell in your GY; equip it to 1 appropriate monster on the field.'
